      "locked": false,
      "text": "Primary ingress: CLI / Expo / VS Code connect directly to Server sessions. LocalBuddy is an optional sidecar that can answer locally or enqueue the same durable request queue.\nRemoteBuddy dispatches autonomous objectives through that queue. Server streams durable lifecycle events back to clients over SSE/WS.",
